Appendix H: cite the stage-4 systems and model families (nine new bib entries with verification records), align with the logged decision functions

New references, each checked against arXiv, Crossref, the ACL Anthology, PMLR or the Hugging Face API and recorded in verification.jsonl: LightRAG (Findings of EMNLP 2025), HippoRAG 2 (ICML 2025), Cognee (the developers' arXiv study; no peer-reviewed version), SimpleMem, the Llama 3 report, the Gemma 4 report, the gpt-oss model card (existing record re-checked), the Qwen3 report and the Ministral-3-14B-Instruct-2512-BF16 model card. Cited in the appendix text and in the model-family and native-system tables.

Text follows the 2026-09-29 decision on stage-4 decision functions: M1-b as the paired D1-D0 survival difference with a point-estimate criterion, M3 as same sign with no sign judged where the main estimate is zero, N-1 over the five stage-4 systems and N-2 to N-4 including Mem0, the white-box comparison cell chosen by the inferred D and B, LightRAG and HippoRAG 2 as delete-then-insert through their own APIs, and the sandbox details (single-underscore attributes, 4 GiB, 20,000 characters) marked as implementation choices. States that all five families are served with engine-side JSON-schema decoding; the gpt-oss check is left as a TODO. The resolved NOTE comment is removed.

